{{- /*
auth.json — podman/buildah/skopeo registry credentials
(~/.config/containers/auth.json), 0600 via the `private_` source attribute.

GitHub- and GitLab-hosted registries authenticate with STORED KEYS rendered
here at apply time: each `auths` entry is the standard base64("user:PAT")
"auth" field, resolved live from 1Password (onepasswordRead, no cache). This
replaced the `docker-credential-gh` / `docker-credential-glab` credHelpers,
which shelled out to `gh` / `glab auth docker-helper` on every pull. The
format is identical to what `podman login` writes natively.

Token rotation: `chezmoi apply` re-renders this file on every run, so a PAT
rotated in 1Password propagates on the next apply with no script — a target
whose rendered content changed is rewritten by chezmoi's normal file phase.

Runtime rewrites: `podman login` / `logout` rewrites this file; any such
manual change is overwritten by the next apply. Registry credentials are
managed here — add them as 1Password references, not by hand.

Docker Hub (`docker.io`, `dhi.io`) deliberately stays on the keychain-backed
`dockerhub` credHelper populated by
.chezmoiscripts/10-auth/run_onchange_after_auth-dockerhub.sh.tmpl: its PAT is
long-lived and the native keychain is the better store for it. Podman honors
`credHelpers` but ignores `credsStore`; the latter only matters to a real
Docker CLI. The empty index.docker.io keys are Docker CLI legacy entries.

The JPI GitLab item is referenced by UUID (stable across renames), matching
.chezmoiscripts/10-auth/run_onchange_after_auth-gitlab.sh.tmpl. `trim` guards
against a trailing newline in `op read` output, and `toJson` quotes the
composed value.
*/ -}}
{{- $ghUser := onepasswordRead "op://Private/GitHub/username" | trim -}}
{{- $ghPat := onepasswordRead "op://Private/GitHub/PAT" | trim -}}
{{- $jpiUser := onepasswordRead "op://Private/ayf4zcy2khkrvdoexfdvbqgzka/username" | trim -}}
{{- $jpiPat := onepasswordRead "op://Private/ayf4zcy2khkrvdoexfdvbqgzka/PAT" | trim -}}
{{- $glUser := onepasswordRead "op://Private/GitLab/username" | trim -}}
{{- $glPat := onepasswordRead "op://Private/GitLab/PAT" | trim -}}
{{- $ghAuth := printf "%s:%s" $ghUser $ghPat | b64enc -}}
{{- $jpiAuth := printf "%s:%s" $jpiUser $jpiPat | b64enc -}}
{{- $glAuth := printf "%s:%s" $glUser $glPat | b64enc -}}
{
  "auths": {
    "docker.pkg.github.com": {
      "auth": {{ $ghAuth | toJson }}
    },
    "ghcr.io": {
      "auth": {{ $ghAuth | toJson }}
    },
    "https://index.docker.io/v1/": {},
    "https://index.docker.io/v1/access-token": {},
    "https://index.docker.io/v1/refresh-token": {},
    "registry.gitlab.com": {
      "auth": {{ $glAuth | toJson }}
    },
    "registry.jpi.app": {
      "auth": {{ $jpiAuth | toJson }}
    }
  },
  "credsStore": "dockerhub",
  "credHelpers": {
    "docker.io": "dockerhub",
    "dhi.io": "dockerhub"
  }
}
